{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aliens are invading \u2014 and you're the last line of defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build, upgrade, and strategize</strong> your way to victory in this tower defense game where every decision matters. Place towers smartly across each map, adapt your tactics to different enemy types, and defend your portal from the incoming waves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>8 Unique Towers</strong> (6 currently available) \u2014 each with distinct abilities and upgrade paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>30 Handcrafted Maps</strong> (20 currently playable) with varied layouts and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Strategic Gameplay</strong> \u2014 every tower placement and upgrade decision counts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uded2 <strong>In-Game Shop</strong> \u2014 earn currency through gameplay to unlock new upgrades (coming soon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Infinite Mode</strong> \u2014 test your defenses on procedurally generated maps (coming soon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Custom Sound &amp; Music</strong> \u2014 immersive audio to accompany the chaos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>, with regular updates and new content planned. Your feedback can directly shape the future of the game \u2014 join the community and help us make it even better!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807420?t=1752228869","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807420/f438c8f194557022dcec2614d99db9050b3d61f8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752228869","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807420/e28432a2895517712f542a4889d